# scenario: proxy-hop-limit
# doc: proxy-hop-limit.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude proxy-hop-limit.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: the test writes proxy-hop-limit.hop-01.md through proxy-hop-limit.hop-16.md from proxy-hop-limit.hop.md; the entry and every hop proxy to the next from start, before any provider launch
# given: the chain counts the origin document, so 15 hand-offs are adopted and the 16th (hop-15 to hop-16, an existing file) is refused with LifecycleProxyCycle (limit 16)
# given: the refusal before launch ends the run with no catch event and no finalize
# given: the provider never launches
event initialize
event start
event hop-01:initialize
event hop-01:start
event hop-02:initialize
event hop-02:start
event hop-03:initialize
event hop-03:start
event hop-04:initialize
event hop-04:start
event hop-05:initialize
event hop-05:start
event hop-06:initialize
event hop-06:start
event hop-07:initialize
event hop-07:start
event hop-08:initialize
event hop-08:start
event hop-09:initialize
event hop-09:start
event hop-10:initialize
event hop-10:start
event hop-11:initialize
event hop-11:start
event hop-12:initialize
event hop-12:start
event hop-13:initialize
event hop-13:start
event hop-14:initialize
event hop-14:start
event hop-15:initialize
event hop-15:start
exit 1
